> Even if we should clone data, I wonder how this can happen

Really simplified:

```
function clearRefinement(helper, refinement) {
  helper.clearRefinement(refinement.attributeName, refinement.name);
}
let refinement = { name: 'val' };
let handleClick = clearRefinement.bind(helper, refinement);
<Template onClick={handleClick} templateData={refinement} transformData={(data) => { data.name = 'notval'; return data; }} />
```
